{"id":"leetcode-3304","version":1,"status":"approved","title":"Find the K-th Character in String Game I","summary":"Alice begins with the string \"a\".","statement":"Alice begins with the string \"a\". Bob instructs Alice to repeatedly generate a new string by incrementing each character in the current string by one in the English alphabet and appending it to the original string. This process continues indefinitely until the string has at least k characters. Return the value of the k-th character in the final string.","constraints":["Start with word equal to a.","In each operation append a copy of the whole word with every letter advanced by one cyclic alphabet step.","Return the one-indexed k-th character once the word is long enough."],"topics":["strings","bit manipulation","simulation"],"prerequisites":[],"signature":{"name":"kth_character_string_game_one","parameters":[{"name":"k","annotation":"int","adapter":"raw","source_parameter":null}],"returns":"str","return_adapter":"raw","node_policy":"values","result_mode":"return","mutated_parameter":null,"immutable_parameters":[]},"starter_code":"def kth_character_string_game_one(k: int) -> str:\n    # Write your solution here.\n    pass\n","reference_solution":"def kth_character_string_game_one(k):\n    return chr(97+(k-1).bit_count()%26)\n","brute_force_solution":null,"known_wrong_solutions":["def kth_character_string_game_one(k):\n    return chr(97+k.bit_count()%26)\n","def kth_character_string_game_one(k):\n    return chr(97+((k-1).bit_count()+1)%26)\n"],"target_time_complexity":"O(1)","target_space_complexity":"O(1)","estimated_minutes":20,"rubric":{"algorithmic_insight":1,"prerequisites":1,"implementation":1,"performance_pressure":0,"edge_cases":0},"hints":["Each expansion doubles the word.","A position in the appended half comes from the matching earlier position plus one letter.","The number of appended-half choices on the path to k-1 equals its set-bit count.","Advance a by that count modulo 26."],"editorial":"Advance a by that count modulo 26.","tests":[{"id":"lc-3304-1","arguments":[5],"expected":"b","comparator":"exact","visible":true,"explanation":"The words grow as a, ab, abbc, and abbcbccd; position five is b.","expected_node_order":null},{"id":"lc-3304-2","arguments":[1],"expected":"a","comparator":"exact","visible":true,"explanation":"The first character is the initial a.","expected_node_order":null},{"id":"lc-3304-3","arguments":[2],"expected":"b","comparator":"exact","visible":false,"explanation":null,"expected_node_order":null},{"id":"lc-3304-4","arguments":[3],"expected":"b","comparator":"exact","visible":false,"explanation":null,"expected_node_order":null},{"id":"lc-3304-5","arguments":[4],"expected":"c","comparator":"exact","visible":false,"explanation":null,"expected_node_order":null},{"id":"lc-3304-6","arguments":[6],"expected":"c","comparator":"exact","visible":false,"explanation":null,"expected_node_order":null},{"id":"lc-3304-7","arguments":[7],"expected":"c","comparator":"exact","visible":false,"explanation":null,"expected_node_order":null},{"id":"lc-3304-8","arguments":[8],"expected":"d","comparator":"exact","visible":false,"explanation":null,"expected_node_order":null},{"id":"lc-3304-9","arguments":[9],"expected":"b","comparator":"exact","visible":false,"explanation":null,"expected_node_order":null},{"id":"lc-3304-10","arguments":[10],"expected":"c","comparator":"exact","visible":false,"explanation":null,"expected_node_order":null},{"id":"lc-3304-11","arguments":[16],"expected":"e","comparator":"exact","visible":false,"explanation":null,"expected_node_order":null},{"id":"lc-3304-12","arguments":[17],"expected":"b","comparator":"exact","visible":false,"explanation":null,"expected_node_order":null},{"id":"lc-3304-13","arguments":[31],"expected":"e","comparator":"exact","visible":false,"explanation":null,"expected_node_order":null},{"id":"lc-3304-14","arguments":[32],"expected":"f","comparator":"exact","visible":false,"explanation":null,"expected_node